<title>UK: Scot Media has 19.9 pct of Grampian.</title>
<headline>Scot Media has 19.9 pct of Grampian.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Media Group Plc  said on Tuesday it had bought another 10 percent of the issued share capital of Grampian Television Plc at 320 pence per share, bringing its total holding in the company to 19.9 percent.  </p>
<p>Earlier, Scottish Media said it would pay about 105 million stg for Grampian, the ITV licence holder for northern Scotland. Scottish Media, formerly Scottish Television, broadcasts to Glasgow, Edinburgh and central Scotland.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
